        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dEpcquroDIxG1rHjCJiK-524" parent="dEpcquroDIxG1rHjCJiK-7" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Panel 1 - Landing Page&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the landing page for the Stack Overflow Insights Application. The app header includes the version number and the time and date.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The three main tabs are visible, with none selected. A call to action prompts the user to select a tab to get started.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="600" x="80" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dEpcquroDIxG1rHjCJiK-525" parent="dEpcquroDIxG1rHjCJiK-7" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Panel 2 - Metrics Over Time&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;The first tab allows the user to view various metrics over time. The stacked bar chart shows the breakdown of Questions, Answers, and Comments in the given date range.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The right-hand dialog allows users to include/exclude certain tags and search by tag name. The date range is also configurable.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="600" x="1330" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dEpcquroDIxG1rHjCJiK-526" parent="dEpcquroDIxG1rHjCJiK-7" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Panel 3 - Search Database&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;The second tab allows the user to search for specific posts in a variety of ways. The right-hand dialog allows the user to include/exclude post types. The title and author fields may be searched to narrow results. Each table column may be used to order the results in ascending or descending order.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Selecting a post brings the user to Panel 4. Selecting specifically the Author attribute brings the user to Panel 5.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="600" x="80" y="1270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dEpcquroDIxG1rHjCJiK-125" parent="0" style="locked=0;" value="histogram" />
